# Netflix Content Analysis in Microsoft Excel



An end-to-end Excel analysis of the Netflix titles catalogue: data cleaning, pivot-style summaries, charts, interactive dashboards, findings and recommendations. Everything lives in one workbook, and every number is a live formula that traces back to the cleaned data.

